[
    {
        "content": "<p>When a lake build encounters failures, it continues running all remaining scheduled jobs before reporting results and exiting. In some scenarios, short-circuiting and stopping the build early might be desirable. I'd like to introduce a <code>--fail-fast</code> mode to make this happen.</p>\n<p>I opened the RFC at <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/13074\">lean4#13074</a> and an implementation in <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/13075\">lean4#13075</a>. As part of this I'm introducing a 'graceful cancellation' mechanism that might be useful in other scenarios.</p>",
        "id": 581256326,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcelo Lynch",
        "timestamp": 1774315947
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I've been working on the <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/downstream-reports/\">mathlib downstream reports</a> which by construction performs a lot of failing builds, so a feature like this would potentially save a lot of compute.</p>\n<p>I wanted to quantify how much, so I I parsed 456 distinct failing-build logs from the last two weeks of the workflow -- this has builds not of mathlib but of 18 different downstream projects. Then I compared when the first non-trailing <code>error:</code> line appears and the per-target Building X (Ns) durations were summed before and after that point.</p>\n<p>The result is that  66<strong>% of the compile time across the corpus happens after the first error</strong>. These results are skewed in the sense that only failing builds have been probed, but it makes this feature pretty desirable, especially on CI scenarios like this one.</p>\n<p>One pattern that is relevant to my system, for example: failures where a downstream referenced a deleted file. Lake's import resolution fails fast, but it still tries to build every other module anyway, when it could have exited immediately</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">✖</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2861</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">2990</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Running</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PointwiseConvergence</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">no</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">such</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">directory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">code</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4294967294</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">home</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">actions</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">runner</span><span class=\"bp\">/_</span><span class=\"n\">work</span><span class=\"bp\">/_</span><span class=\"n\">temp</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">downstream</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">regression</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">downstreams</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">physlib</span><span class=\"bp\">/.</span><span class=\"n\">lake</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">packages</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">PointwiseConvergence</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">✖</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2862</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">2990</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Running</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Physlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Mathematics</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Distribution</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Physlib</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Mathematics</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Distribution</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bad</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">'</span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PointwiseConvergence'</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">✖</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2863</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">2990</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Running</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Physlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpaceAndTime</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Space</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Derivatives</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Physlib</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">SpaceAndTime</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Space</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Derivatives</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bad</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">'</span><span class=\"n\">Physlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Mathematics</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Distribution</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic'</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
